            "exit_code": 0,
            "stdout_sha256": "bf5171bbfe837e03c6355f487b863ececf3716935c5375216a04b3d128ed8ae7",
            "failure_scenario": "A future caller gates on t2_preflight.sh's exit code: a fully green run (no [FAIL] row, e.g. after the bump) exits 1 and is read as NO-GO. Fail-closed, so advisory.",
            "precision_class": "advisory"
          }
        },
